@startuml
' Sequence diagram: checkout confirmation flow with client-to-checkout_shop association (pvapi-gbho)

actor "Client" as Client
participant "Checkout API\nHandler" as Handler
participant "Confirm()" as Confirm
participant "writeCheckout()" as WriteCheckout
participant "Database" as DB
participant "CreateAndAssociate()" as CreateAssoc
participant "Create()" as Create
participant "SetCartClientID()" as SetCart
participant "SetCheckoutShopClientID()" as SetShop

== Checkout Confirmation ==

Client -> Handler: POST /checkout/confirm\n(session_id, value_paid, items, client_email)
Handler -> Confirm: Confirm(pool, sessionID, req)
Confirm -> DB: BEGIN
activate Confirm
Confirm -> DB: checkIdempotency()
DB --> Confirm: not done (new)
Confirm -> DB: resolveCart() → cartID
DB --> Confirm: cartID, itemCount
Confirm -> DB: validateStock(items)
DB --> Confirm: stock available

Confirm -> WriteCheckout: writeCheckout(tx, cartID, items)
activate WriteCheckout
WriteCheckout -> DB: INSERT checkouts
DB --> WriteCheckout: unique_id
WriteCheckout -> DB: SELECT checkout id
DB --> WriteCheckout: checkoutID
WriteCheckout -> DB: INSERT package_reserved (batch)
DB --> WriteCheckout: done
WriteCheckout -> DB: INSERT checkout_shop\n(financial breakdown)
DB --> WriteCheckout: done
WriteCheckout -> DB: UPDATE value_discrepancy
DB --> WriteCheckout: done
WriteCheckout -> DB: UPDATE carts → FINISHED-
DB --> WriteCheckout: done
WriteCheckout --> Confirm: unique_id
deactivate WriteCheckout

Confirm -> DB: COMMIT
DB --> Confirm: ok
Confirm --> Handler: { success, unique_id, qr_code, status }
deactivate Confirm
Handler --> Client: 200 OK

== Post-Response Client Association ==

note right of Handler: Best-effort after HTTP response

Handler -> CreateAssoc: CreateAndAssociate(pool,\nclientName, email, hash, cartID)
activate CreateAssoc
CreateAssoc -> DB: BEGIN
CreateAssoc -> Create: Create(tx, name, email, hash)
activate Create

alt Existing client email
  Create -> DB: SELECT users by email
  DB --> Create: existing userID
  Create -> DB: SELECT clients by userID
  DB --> Create: existing clientID (isNew=false)
else New email
  Create -> DB: INSERT users + clients
  DB --> Create: new clientID (isNew=true)
end
Create --> CreateAssoc: clientID, isNew
deactivate Create

CreateAssoc -> SetCart: SetCartClientID(tx, clientID, cartID)
activate SetCart
SetCart -> DB: UPDATE carts SET client_id = $1
DB --> SetCart: done
deactivate SetCart

CreateAssoc -> SetShop: SetCheckoutShopClientID(tx, clientID, cartID)
activate SetShop
note right of SetShop: UPDATE checkout_shop cs SET client_id = $1\nFROM checkouts chk WHERE chk.cart_id = $2\nAND cs.checkout_id = chk.id
SetShop -> DB: Execute join-based UPDATE
DB --> SetShop: done
deactivate SetShop

CreateAssoc -> DB: COMMIT
DB --> CreateAssoc: ok
deactivate CreateAssoc

note right of Handler: Both client_id updates succeed or roll back atomically

Handler -> DB: ResolvePickupEmailData (optional)
Handler --> Client: Pickup confirmation email (async)
@enduml
